<title>USA: AMEX to list Illinova, Fla.Progress, Jan 28.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Illinova, Fla.Progress, Jan 28.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Monday it would begin trading options on shares of two power companies, Illinova Corp and Florida Progress Corp, on Tuesday, January 28.</p>
<p>The following table lists the underlying stock's ticker symbol, strike prices, exercise months, position limits and specialist.  </p>
<p>Ticker	 Strikes	   Exercises   Pos Lts  Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	25, 30, 35	Feb, Mar,   7,500    Group One</p>
<p>				     Jun, Sep</p>
<p>	30, 35, 40	Feb, Mar,   7,500    Spear, Leeds</p>
<p>				     Jun, Sep</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750)) ((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
